[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3 uid="uid://unitsprite2dgradtex"]

; One variable: a Sprite2D whose `texture` is an inline GradientTexture2D sub-resource. Every
; other Sprite2D scene resolves an ExtResource image (or, in `unit-sprite2d-canvastexture`, a
; CanvasTexture that wraps one) through the path branch. Losing the inline branch leaves them
; pixel-identical, and here the sprite becomes a magenta missing-resource placeholder.

